              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="inline-icon text-[#FF7A7A] mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"></path></svg></span> Numéros de piste</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="inline-icon text-[#FF7A7A] mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"></path></svg></span> Trois mots lisibles</li>
